# Spiral stairs, one level of them: a column in the middle and wedge-shaped steps round
# it, one whole turn from this level's floor up to the next one's (1.2 higher), rising
# clockwise as seen from above. Every level of a stack starts in the same place, so the
# flights join into one spiral. Made with the first step on the north side; turned in the
# game to start on the side the stair is entered from. A step reaches 0.25 down, under the
# step before it; below the floor that is cut off, except where the stair goes on down.
# (how a model is laid out: README.txt)
